      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020B4DCB2C8CC28002E002E002E0020D314B370C544C9C0BC29C73CB85C0020C720D5590020AC04000AC5B8B2C8D55CD14CC11C0020BC1BC558B294B370002C00100001BE00000AB9CEC7740020C18CADF9C801C7780020C544C774C608C694002E002E002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 노력하면 어떻게든 되겠지만,\n저도 많이 소극적이라서요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
