      "displayText": "다들 어떤 분들이셨나요...?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B4E40020C5B4B5A40020BD84B4E4C774C168B098C694002E002E002E003F00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이야기를 들어 보니 조금 어려울 것 같네요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C57CAE30B97C0020B4E4C5B40020BCF4B2C80020C870AE080020C5B4B824C6B80020AC830020AC19B124C694002E002E002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "팔데아지방에서 유학 중인 언니가\n꽁어름과 드니차는 툭하면 싸운다고 했고...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D314B370C544C9C0BC29C5D0C11C0020C720D5590020C911C7780020C5B8B2C8AC00000AAF41C5B4B984ACFC0020B4DCB2C8CC28B2940020D22DD558BA740020C2F8C6B4B2E4ACE00020D588ACE0002E002E002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아웃도어? 불 피우기?\n그런 건 위험해서 안 돼요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C6C3B3C4C5B4003F0020BD880020D53CC6B0AE30003F000AADF8B7F00020AC740020C704D5D8D574C11C0020C5480020B3FCC694002E002E002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "게다가 쟝고요? 세비퍼와 싸우는\n무서운 포켓몬이잖아요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC8CB2E4AC000020C7DDACE0C694003F0020C138BE44D37CC6400020C2F8C6B0B294000ABB34C11CC6B40020D3ECCF13BAACC774C796C544C694002E002E002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으음... 죄송하지만,\n드니차의 친구를 찾는 건 포기할게요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73CC74C002E002E002E0020C8C4C1A1D558C9C0B9CC002C000AB4DCB2C8CC28C7580020CE5CAD6CB97C0020CC3EB2940020AC740020D3ECAE30D560AC8CC694002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "소극적인 저를 대신해\n알아봐 주셔서 감사해요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
